flowchart TB
  classDef client fill:#E0F2FE,stroke:#0EA5E9,color:#0C4A6E,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef frontend fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,color:#14532D,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef backend fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#7C2D12,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef eventing fill:#EDE9FE,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#4C1D95,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef azure fill:#FCE7F3,stroke:#DB2777,color:#831843,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef data fill:#F1F5F9,stroke:#64748B,color:#334155,stroke-width:1px;
  classDef deploy fill:#0F172A,stroke:#0F172A,color:#F8FAFC,stroke-width:1px;

  C[Clients\nReact web + mobile]:::client
  F[Frontend Shell\nThread list + composer + presence]:::frontend
  B[Backend API\nAuthZ/tenant checks + commands->events]:::backend
  R[Event Router\nPersistence + projections + audit]:::eventing
  W[Azure Web PubSub\nRealtime fan-out only]:::azure
  D[Cosmos DB\nEvent log + state/projections]:::data

  C -->|HTTPS| F
  F -->|commands| B
  B -->|realtime tokens| W
  B -->|events| R
  R -->|projections| D
  W -.->|fan-out| C
  W --> D

  subgraph AZ["Azure Deployment Shape (azd up)"]
    DEP1[Resource Group]:::deploy
    DEP2[ACR]:::deploy
    DEP3[Container Apps Env]:::deploy
    DEP4[Backend + Frontend Apps]:::deploy
    DEP5[Web PubSub]:::deploy
    DEP6[Cosmos DB]:::deploy
    DEP7[App Insights + Log Analytics]:::deploy
    DEP1 --> DEP2 --> DEP3 --> DEP4 --> DEP5 --> DEP6 --> DEP7
  end

  B -. deploys on .-> DEP4
  W -. provisioned by .-> DEP5
  D -. provisioned by .-> DEP6